OL,3,ATrump chooses top spy boss to run new
OL,4,AAI taskforce
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has named the
OL,7,Fdirector of national intelligence as
OL,8,Fthe head of a new taskforce on AI
OL,9,Fwhich, he said, will coordinate
OL,10,Fgovernment engagement with consumers,
OL,11,Fcompanies and "religious
OL,12,Forganizations".
OL,14,FJay Clayton will head a taskforce that
OL,15,Fhas drawn criticism from the likes of
OL,16,FDemocratic Senator Elizabeth Warren who
OL,17,Fhas called for regulation of AI.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
